        "name": "Pix, Faerie Companion",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Pix fires magical bolts of energy whenever the champion he's following attacks another enemy unit. These bolts are homing, but can be intercepted by other units.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lulu is assisted by Pix the faerie. When Lulu Attacks, Pix fires 3 bolts at her target, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">((15 ~ 117) + (15% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to the first enemy hit.",
