        "name": "Glitterlance",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Pix and Lulu each fire a bolt of magical energy that damages and heavily slows all enemies it hits.",
        "bodyHtml": "Lulu and Pix each fire a piercing bolt dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(60/95/130/165/200 + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> by 80%, decaying over 2 seconds.<br /><br />Enemies take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(30/47.5/65/82.5/100 + ([[si:scaleap]]25% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> from additional bolts.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">70% damage</span> to Minions.</span>",
