      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "LuluW",
        "name": "Whimsy",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "If cast on an ally, grants them Attack Speed and Move Speed for a short time. If cast on an enemy, turns them into an adorable critter that can't attack or cast spells.",
        "bodyHtml": "When used on an ally, Lulu grants <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(25% + ([[si:scaleap]]5% per 100 Ability Power)) Move Speed</span> and <span>20/22.5/25/27.5/30% Attack Speed</span> for 3/3.25/3.5/3.75/4 seconds.<br /><br />When used on an enemy, Lulu <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Polymorphs</span> them for 1.2/1.4/1.6/1.8/2 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Polymorphed</span> targets are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Silenced</span>, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Disarmed</span>, and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 60.</span>",
