        "name": "Help, Pix!",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "If cast on an ally, commands Pix to jump to an ally and shield them. He then follows them and aids their attacks. If cast on an enemy, commands Pix to jump to an enemy and damage them. He then follows them and grants you vision of that enemy.",
        "bodyHtml": "When used on an ally, Pix jumps to them and grants <span>Pix, Faerie Companion</span> for 6 seconds. If the ally is a champion, Pix also grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(70/110/150/190/230 + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) Shield</span> for 2.5 seconds.<br /><br />When used on an enemy champion, Pix hampers them, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(70/110/150/190/230 + ([[si:scaleap]]50% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and granting <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> of them for 4 seconds.",
